  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods and Gender Empowerment in Post Conflict Areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at reducing poverty by strengthening livelihoods and increasing food production with irrigation, organic supplies, production of cash crops, inland fisheries, and small industries. People will be mobilized to further strengthen their livelihoods and food production. People will be capacitated on the rights of the women and children, and on how to reduce alcohol and drug consumption. The project will also work to influence local institutions to support these aims effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
